   "हो॒ता वि॑ष्टीमे॒न ज॑रित॒रोऽथामो॑ दै॒व"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "pa̱tnī yadṛ̭śyate pa̱tnī yakṣya̭māṇā jarita̱ro'thāmo̭ dai̱va",
   "ho̱tā vi̭ṣṭīme̱na ja̭rita̱ro'thāmo̭ dai̱va"
  ],
